       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CALLER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 A PIC 99 VALUE 6.
       01 R PIC 999.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           CALL "SQUARE" USING A R
           DISPLAY R
           STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM CALLER.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SQUARE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 X PIC 99.
       01 Y PIC 999.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING X Y.
           COMPUTE Y = X * X
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM SQUARE.
